# Play test of Deepwatch Station (CIPlay deepwatch_station, in a test world 'CI ...'): a sunken island, 16 m under the
# sea. No quest: the station's locker, the hatch beside it, the submarine's chest, the puffers. Points as in its recipe
# (heights over the island's own water line).
island Deepwatch Station
offset 0 0
expect animals Puffer fish 3
wait 3
kill Puffer fish
# Through the door into the bunker, its locker
at -1.5 -9 h=4
at -1.5 -3 h=4.1
open Station locker
# The air pocket in the annex
at 6 -2 h=4.1
# The hatch in the sand beside the station
use stationhatch
open Under the hatch
# The submarine's chest
at -15.5 16 h=3
open The submarine's chest
